WEBVTT

00:00:00.066 --> 00:00:04.117
AgentPay: buy the next inference inside an owner-defined policy. Interactive simulation; no new payment.

00:00:04.117 --> 00:00:09.502
Set a 5 USDC task budget and require approval. The per-inference ceiling is separate: 0.1 USDC.

00:00:09.502 --> 00:00:16.350
The baseline reproduces a duplicate charge. Save the task before procurement. The capacity trigger is scripted.

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:22.857
Compare real model channels on aiplans.dev. Toolkit is the configured machine-fulfillment route.

00:00:22.857 --> 00:00:28.560
The agent waits for your approval. A policy decision comes before a purchase.

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:34.105
A Toolkit request binds the model and token bounds. This screen replays historical payment evidence.

00:00:34.105 --> 00:00:46.259
Recorded September 7 request: 17 input plus 256 output tokens. Monad settlement: 0.000001 USDC, not the full ceiling.

00:00:46.259 --> 00:00:52.109
Inspect the retry guard. This teaching fixture is separate from the historical model output.

00:00:52.109 --> 00:00:58.468
Three acceptance tests execute locally in the browser. The owner verifies the deliverable.

00:00:58.468 --> 00:01:08.635
The complete loop: commission, checkpoint, discovery, authorization, settlement, delivery.

00:01:08.635 --> 00:01:14.476
Inspect the historical proof and transaction. No new model call, signature or charge is created by this demo.

00:01:14.476 --> 00:01:18.976
Quick preview is available before starting. It grants no purchase permission and records no acceptance.
